  Potentially a little Ratburn introduction

2. 🚨 Discipline
  Rule-break tracking
  Infractions
  Demerits
  Detention
  Temporary restrictions
  Temporary bans
  Permanent bans
  Full history/ledger
  Mod overrides
  Expiration handling
  Audit logging

3. 🧹 Chat Filter
  Add multiple words at once
  Remove individual words
  View filter
  Admin-only modification
  Mod+ viewing
  Whole-word/word-boundary matching
  Logging changes
  Potentially different actions for different filter entries later

4. 📝 Daily Quiz
  Daily question
  Private/ephemeral answers
  Per-user score
  Answer tracking
